hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"244","[AI-translation] Hamayen Muhammad bin Bashshar ne hadith ki, kaha: Hamayen Yahya bin Sa'id ne hadith ki, kaha: Hamayen Sufyan Thawri ne hadith ki, kaha: Hamein Abu Ishaq ne khabar di, Bara' bin 'Azib se, unhon ne kaha: Un se ek shakhs ne kaha: Kya tum Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se bhaag gaye, Ae Aba 'Amarata? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam peeth na mudae, lekin jaldi karne wale log mud gae. Hawazin ne teeroon se unka istaqbal kiya, aur Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam apni khachar par thay, aur Abu Sufyan bin Harith bin 'Abdul Muttalib uski lagam pakde hue thay, aur Rasulullah farmate thay: Main Nabi hoon, na jhoot, main 'Abdul Muttalib ka beta hoon."
